#### REQ-LENS-008-008: Alert Notification Templates

**Status**: Mandatory
**Rationale**: Consistent, actionable alert messages

**Alert Template** (Slack/Email):
```
🚨 **Consumer Lag Alert - {SEVERITY}**

**Consumer Group**: {consumer_group_name}
**Topic**: {topic_name}
**Current Lag**: {lag_minutes} minutes ({lag_messages} messages)
**Threshold**: {threshold} minutes

**Impact**: Messages are delayed by {lag_minutes} minutes. Users may experience stale data.

**Actions**:
1. Check consumer health: [Lenses.io Link]
2. View consumer logs: [CloudWatch Link]
3. Runbook: [Confluence Link]

**Acknowledge in PagerDuty**: {pagerduty_link}
```

**Implementation**:

**Slack Alert Template (Markdown)**:
```python
# Slack alert template using Block Kit
from typing import Dict

def generate_slack_alert(alert_data: Dict) -> Dict:
    """Generate Slack Block Kit message for consumer lag alert.

    Args:
        alert_data: Alert details

    Returns:
        Slack Block Kit formatted message
    """
    severity = alert_data["severity"]
    severity_emoji = {
        "critical": "🔴",
        "warning": "🟡",
        "info": "🔵"
    }

    severity_color = {
        "critical": "#FF0000",
        "warning": "#FFA500",
        "info": "#0000FF"
    }

    return {
        "attachments": [
            {
                "color": severity_color[severity],
                "blocks": [
                    {
                        "type": "header",
                        "text": {
                            "type": "plain_text",
                            "text": f"{severity_emoji[severity]} Consumer Lag Alert - {severity.upper()}"
                        }
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "section",
                        "fields": [
                            {
                                "type": "mrkdwn",
                                "text": f"*Consumer Group:*\n{alert_data['consumer_group']}"
                            },
                            {
                                "type": "mrkdwn",
                                "text": f"*Topic:*\n{alert_data['topic']}"
                            },
                            {
                                "type": "mrkdwn",
                                "text": f"*Current Lag:*\n{alert_data['lag_minutes']} minutes ({alert_data['lag_messages']:,} messages)"
                            },
                            {
                                "type": "mrkdwn",
                                "text": f"*Threshold:*\n{alert_data['threshold_minutes']} minutes"
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "section",
                        "text": {
                            "type": "mrkdwn",
                            "text": f"*Impact:* Messages are delayed by {alert_data['lag_minutes']} minutes. Users may experience stale data."
                        }
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "section",
                        "text": {
                            "type": "mrkdwn",
                            "text": "*Recommended Actions:*\n" +
                                    "1. Check consumer health in Lenses.io\n" +
                                    "2. Review consumer logs in CloudWatch\n" +
                                    "3. Follow runbook procedures\n" +
                                    "4. Acknowledge in PagerDuty (critical alerts)"
                        }
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "actions",
                        "elements": [
                            {
                                "type": "button",
                                "text": {
                                    "type": "plain_text",
                                    "text": "View in Lenses.io"
                                },
                                "url": f"https://lenses.company.com/kafka/consumers/{alert_data['consumer_group']}",
                                "style": "primary"
                            },
                            {
                                "type": "button",
                                "text": {
                                    "type": "plain_text",
                                    "text": "CloudWatch Logs"
                                },
                                "url": f"https://console.aws.amazon.com/cloudwatch/home?region=us-east-1#logsV2:log-groups/log-group//aws/eks/eaas-prod/consumer/{alert_data['consumer_group']}"
                            },
                            {
                                "type": "button",
                                "text": {
                                    "type": "plain_text",
                                    "text": "Runbook"
                                },
                                "url": "https://wiki.company.com/runbooks/consumer-lag"
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "context",
                        "elements": [
                            {
                                "type": "mrkdwn",
                                "text": f"Alert triggered at {alert_data['timestamp']} | Business Unit: {alert_data.get('business_unit', 'Unknown')}"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ]
            }
        ]
    }
```

**Email Alert Template (HTML)**:
```python
from jinja2 import Template
from typing import Dict

EMAIL_TEMPLATE = Template("""
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <style>
        body { font-family: Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 1.6; color: #333; }
        .container { max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 20px; }
        .header { background-color: {% if severity == 'critical' %}#FF0000{% elif severity == 'warning' %}#FFA500{% else %}#0000FF{% endif %}; color: white; padding: 20px; border-radius: 5px; }
        .content { background-color: #f4f4f4; padding: 20px; margin-top: 20px; border-radius: 5px; }
        .detail-table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin: 20px 0; }
        .detail-table th { background-color: #333; color: white; padding: 10px; text-align: left; }
        .detail-table td { background-color: white; padding: 10px; border-bottom: 1px solid #ddd; }
        .actions { margin-top: 20px; }
        .button { display: inline-block; padding: 10px 20px; background-color: #007bff; color: white; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 5px; margin-right: 10px; }
        .impact-warning { background-color: #fff3cd; border-left: 4px solid #ffc107; padding: 15px; margin: 20px 0; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <div class="header">
            <h1>🚨 Consumer Lag Alert - {{ severity|upper }}</h1>
        </div>

        <div class="content">
            <h2>Alert Details</h2>
            <table class="detail-table">
                <tr>
                    <th>Property</th>
                    <th>Value</th>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td><strong>Consumer Group</strong></td>
                    <td>{{ consumer_group }}</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td><strong>Topic</strong></td>
                    <td>{{ topic }}</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td><strong>Current Lag</strong></td>
                    <td>{{ lag_minutes }} minutes ({{ '{:,}'.format(lag_messages) }} messages)</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td><strong>Threshold</strong></td>
                    <td>{{ threshold_minutes }} minutes</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td><strong>Business Unit</strong></td>
                    <td>{{ business_unit or 'Unknown' }}</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td><strong>Alert Time</strong></td>
                    <td>{{ timestamp }}</td>
                </tr>
            </table>

            <div class="impact-warning">
                <strong>⚠️ Impact:</strong> Messages are delayed by {{ lag_minutes }} minutes.
                Users may experience stale data or delayed processing.
            </div>

            <h2>Recommended Actions</h2>
            <ol>
                <li><strong>Check Consumer Health:</strong> Verify consumer pods are running and healthy</li>
                <li><strong>Review Logs:</strong> Check CloudWatch logs for errors or exceptions</li>
                <li><strong>Check Dependencies:</strong> Verify database connections and downstream services</li>
                <li><strong>Follow Runbook:</strong> Execute troubleshooting procedures from runbook</li>
                {% if severity == 'critical' %}
                <li><strong>Acknowledge PagerDuty:</strong> Acknowledge incident within 15 minutes to prevent escalation</li>
                {% endif %}
            </ol>

            <div class="actions">
                <a href="https://lenses.company.com/kafka/consumers/{{ consumer_group }}" class="button">View in Lenses.io</a>
                <a href="https://console.aws.amazon.com/cloudwatch/home?region=us-east-1#logsV2:log-groups/log-group//aws/eks/eaas-prod/consumer/{{ consumer_group }}" class="button">CloudWatch Logs</a>
                <a href="https://wiki.company.com/runbooks/consumer-lag" class="button">Runbook</a>
                {% if pagerduty_incident_url %}
                <a href="{{ pagerduty_incident_url }}" class="button" style="background-color: #06AC38;">PagerDuty Incident</a>
                {% endif %}
            </div>
        </div>

        <div style="margin-top: 30px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-top: 1px solid #ddd; font-size: 12px; color: #666;">
            <p><strong>This is an automated alert from Lenses.io Consumer Lag Monitoring.</strong></p>
            <p>If you believe this alert was triggered in error, please contact the Platform Engineering team.</p>
            <p>Consumer Lag SLA: 99.9% of measurements ≤5 minutes per ADR-IFR-008</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
""")

def generate_email_alert(alert_data: Dict) -> str:
    """Generate HTML email for consumer lag alert.

    Args:
        alert_data: Alert details

    Returns:
        HTML email content
    """
    return EMAIL_TEMPLATE.render(**alert_data)
```

**PagerDuty Alert Payload**:
```python
from typing import Dict
from datetime import datetime

def generate_pagerduty_alert(alert_data: Dict) -> Dict:
    """Generate PagerDuty Events API v2 payload.

    Args:
        alert_data: Alert details

    Returns:
        PagerDuty event payload
    """
    return {
        "routing_key": alert_data["pagerduty_routing_key"],
        "event_action": "trigger",
        "dedup_key": f"consumer-lag-{alert_data['consumer_group']}",
        "payload": {
            "summary": f"Consumer Lag: {alert_data['consumer_group']} on {alert_data['topic']} ({alert_data['lag_minutes']}min)",
            "severity": alert_data["severity"],
            "source": "Lenses.io",
            "timestamp": datetime.utcnow().isoformat(),
            "component": "Kafka Consumer",
            "group": alert_data.get("business_unit", "Platform"),
            "class": "consumer_lag",
            "custom_details": {
                "consumer_group": alert_data["consumer_group"],
                "topic": alert_data["topic"],
                "lag_minutes": alert_data["lag_minutes"],
                "lag_messages": alert_data["lag_messages"],
                "threshold_minutes": alert_data["threshold_minutes"],
                "business_unit": alert_data.get("business_unit", "Unknown"),
                "impact": f"Messages delayed by {alert_data['lag_minutes']} minutes",
                "sla_status": "VIOLATED" if alert_data["lag_minutes"] > 5 else "COMPLIANT"
            }
        },
        "links": [
            {
                "href": f"https://lenses.company.com/kafka/consumers/{alert_data['consumer_group']}",
                "text": "View Consumer in Lenses.io"
            },
            {
                "href": f"https://console.aws.amazon.com/cloudwatch/home?region=us-east-1#logsV2:log-groups/log-group//aws/eks/eaas-prod/consumer/{alert_data['consumer_group']}",
                "text": "CloudWatch Logs"
            },
            {
                "href": "https://wiki.company.com/runbooks/consumer-lag",
                "text": "Consumer Lag Runbook"
            }
        ],
        "images": [
            {
                "src": "https://lenses.company.com/api/consumers/lag/chart.png",
                "href": f"https://lenses.company.com/kafka/consumers/{alert_data['consumer_group']}",
                "alt": "Consumer Lag Chart"
            }
        ]
    }
